Copyright (C) 2026 Rodimus

crtc6845sv: SystemVerilog 6845-family CRT controller (fleet mc6845, MC6845, HD6845S / UM6845, UM6845R, AMS40489,
40226, R6545-1 / SY6545-1, MOS 6545-1) and the MOS 8563 / 8568 VDC (SystemVerilog by Rodimus).

